  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Employment Promotion Program</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="ES">Programa de Promoci&#xf3;n de Empleo</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="ES">El objetivo general es apoyar al Gobierno de Bolivia a implementar pol&#xed;ticas de inserci&#xf3;n, capacitaci&#xf3;n laboral y promoci&#xf3;n de empleo en UE. Se prev&#xe9; como objetivos espec&#xed;ficos: (i) aumentar la oferta de FT enfocada a cubrir las necesidades de habilidades demandadas por UE; (ii) fortalecer las PAML para grupos con retos adicionales; y (iii) promover la creaci&#xf3;n y formalizaci&#xf3;n de emprendimientos.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The general objective is to support the Government of Bolivia to implement insertion, job training and employment promotion policies in the EU. The specific objectives are planned to be: (i) increase the supply of FT focused on meeting the skills needs demanded by UE; (ii) strengthen the PAML for groups with additional challenges; and (iii) promote the creation and formalization of businesses.</narrative>
  </description>
